      "story": {
        "paragraph": "A young girl in a purple dress swings a wooden toy sword on a playship. Other children are playing around her; one girl jumps from a net, another drops a broom and sits in a barrel, and a boy crawls on the deck. A boy dressed as a captain climbs down the stairs with his own sword. The girl in purple and the captain boy face off and play-fight with their wooden swords. Meanwhile, the other three children run around the mast, bump into each other, and fall down. The captain boy falls down during the fight but later stands on the stairs, raising his sword to continue the game.",
